<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TJ International raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TJ International raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston said it upgraded TJ International Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 16-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
